These cat units have their own special death animations instead of floating away in a default white soul.
*[[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]] and [[Crazed Moneko (Special Cat)|Crazed Moneko]] turn into miniature souls of themselves.
*Ubers from the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]] produce an ascending cyan beacon.
*Some Ubers (notably EVA Units and those based off [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angels]]) from the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]] turn into intersecting crimson beams.
*Legend Rares disintegrate into multicolored crystals.
*[[World Trigger Collaboration Event|World Trigger Collaboration]] units [[w:c:worldtrigger:Bail Out|bail out]], showing a beam of light rising.
*Uber Rares from the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]] burst into a shower of wisteria-colored petals. Notably, [[Nezuko_Kamado_(Uber_Rare_Cat)|Nezuko Kamado]] bursts into black petals.

